<p>NOTE:  Net income for the fiscal year ended June 29, 1997, includes a charge of $1,280 related to the company's consolidation of operations in the first quarter of the current fiscal year, a $383 charge in cost of sales to reserve for first generation fibre channel boards in inventory, tax related interest income of $238 and a $612 income tax benefit related to a recovery under a tax sharing agreement with QLogic Corp. (a former subsidiary of the company which was spun off in February 1994).</p>
<p>Excluding these non-recurring items, net of tax, net income would have been $2,240, or 36 cents per share.  Net loss for the fiscal year ended June 30, 1996, includes a $312 gain from the sale of a building at the manufacturing facility in Puerto Rico and a $750 income tax benefit related to the tax sharing agreement.  Excluding these non-recurring items, net of tax, the net loss would have been $10,350, or $1.74 per share.</p>
